  "gaps": [
    "The student's chosen concentration is not known; the 9-semester-hour concentration block cannot be resolved to specific courses (options: General, Business Analysis, Business Project Management, DoD Project Management, Information Technology Management, Leading the Digital Workplace, Marketing, Real Estate Construction and Portfolio Development, Real Estate Marketing Management).",
    "MATH120 is marked '(Preferred)' but the capture does not list the acceptable alternatives.",
    "ECON102 appears both in the Civics, Political & Social Sciences option list and as a major requirement; the capture does not state whether one course may satisfy both.",
    "The capture does not state a residency or minimum institutional-credit requirement, a transfer credit limit, or a minimum GPA.",
    "BUSN499 footnote states 'Prerequisite: Senior Standing and completion of all major courses prior to enrollment. Must be taken as the last course before graduation.'; it does not explicitly state the course must be completed at the institution.",
    "Footnote on Arts & Humanities: literature courses require completion of ENGL101 or ENGL110 (sequencing constraint, not a separate credit requirement)."
